"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202003251745455480002.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Techpowerup Editors Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      techpowerup.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Techpowerup Editors Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Yup, the ASUS RTX 4090 Matrix Platinum is the best RTX 4090 without any doubt.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>09/19/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX™ 4090 24GB GDDR6X Media review Award of Techpowerup Editors Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techpowerup.com/review/asus-geforce-rtx-4090-matrix-platinum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001092249208200773.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtesters.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ...it is the fastest, coolest and most visually impressive RTX 4090 of the moment...\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>03/29/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX™ 4090 24GB GDDR6X Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techtesters.eu/asus-rog-matrix-rtx-4090/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202310052320036910283.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Platinum\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Platinum</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ... the ASUS ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX 4090 is a stellar choice — a commendable piece of hardware indeed.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>09/19/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX™ 4090 24GB GDDR6X Media review Award of Platinum\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/review/asus-rog-geforce-rtx-4090-matrix-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202010121543405630677.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Silver Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      BENCHLIFE\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Silver Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The overall texture and performance of the ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX 4090 is the best among our entire GeForce RTX 4090 series tests, so we will give this graphics card a &quot;Silver&quot; rating.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>11/10/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX™ 4090 24GB GDDR6X Media review Award of Silver Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://benchlife.info/asus-rog-matrix-platinum-geforce-rtx-4090-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1350/201911191849478810279.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Best Performance\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.vmodtech.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Best Performance</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The top-tier Graphic card, Stunning in lighting effect are the most spectacular. Benchmark scores and frame rates in games that are smooth at 4K resolution with Ultra settings, the card is overclocked from the factory and can be overclocked quite a bit more. The sound of the radiator fan is quite quiet because the heat of the GPU is very low, not exceeding 60 degrees, not to the level that the fan profile must accelerate to cool down.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>THAILAND</span> <span>03/02/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Matrix Platinum GeForce RTX™ 4090 24GB GDDR6X Media review Award of Best Performance\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.vmodtech.com/th/article/rog-matrix-platinum-geforce-rtx-4090-24gb-gddr6x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewTitle__0lBVH\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 class=\"pageVideo vnRogFont ProductAwardVideo__vnRogFontSize__n4Ouu\">Video review<